      "description": "A 34-year-old NEET is chased out of his family home, and dies saving a stranger from a traffic accident &mdash; the one worthwhile thing he ever did.<br>\n<br>\nHe wakes as Rudeus Greyrat, a newborn in a world of sword and sorcery, with every memory of the life he wasted intact. This time he swears he will live without regrets, and he begins by studying magic before he can walk.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: The light novel is a rewrite of the web novel and differs from it in places.</i><br>\n<br>\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)",
